{"src":"en","tgt":"sw","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"sw","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7707.5167679999995,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":8947.156862,"text":"Kama umeitazama filamu ya National Treasure, unaweza kufikiri kuwa ramani ya hazina iliandikwa nyuma ya Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":9135.314702,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9139.738225,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9144.998212999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9150.474607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":9155.900532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9160.787636,"samples":28978,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"input","t":13882.430685,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14787.644506,"text":"Kakao ya moto imefikia viwango vya Belgian. Juisi za matunda ni ghali, lakini baada ya muda, utaweza kuhisi utamu wake."},{"kind":"audio","t":14870.198102999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14875.827375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14876.334545999998,"samples":3566,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"audio","t":14911.969383,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":14917.100423,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14922.557297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14924.877247,"samples":16216,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":22225.158946,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":23099.493717,"text":"Hata hivyo, hiyo si kweli. Ingawa kuna kitu kimeandikwa nyuma ya hati hiyo, si ramani ya hazina."},{"kind":"audio","t":23172.126147,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23172.973262,"samples":10142,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"audio","t":23203.095065999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23208.385873,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23211.716215,"samples":22513,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"input","t":29990.177248,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31553.415974,"text":"Unaweza pia kutaka kushauriana na ushauri wa serikali nyingine tofauti na yako, lakini ushauri wao umeandaliwa kwa ajili ya raia wao."},{"kind":"audio","t":31720.227807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31725.277748999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31730.828422000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31736.354344999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31741.592722999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31744.441543999998,"samples":19504,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":41296.39291,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42650.17193800001,"text":"Kisiwa cha Hong Kong kinapa jina eneo la Hong Kong na ni mahali ambapo watalii wengi hukichukulia kama kituo kikuu."},{"kind":"audio","t":42770.985316000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42775.88702,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42781.37422400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42786.688321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42789.173428,"samples":17721,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":49106.818919000005,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":51086.448683,"text":"Yeyote anayekwenda kuendesha gari katika latitudo za joto au kupitia mapito ya milimani anapaswa kufikiria uwezekano wa theluji, barafu, au barafu inayoyeyuka."},{"kind":"audio","t":51289.661980000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51294.892309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51300.171256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51305.777028000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51310.973137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51316.413242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51321.850857000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51322.267620000006,"samples":5795,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":58792.096274,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59936.07810100001,"text":"Utengano na muunganisho huchanganya mabadiliko kwenda na kurudi kati ya makundi hayo mawili."},{"kind":"audio","t":60045.32207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60050.400612000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60055.746308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60061.011226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60061.772403,"samples":8804,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":61184.94549300001,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61474.276784,"text":"kwa kila kizazi."},{"kind":"audio","t":61508.988647000006,"samples":25913,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":950},{"kind":"input","t":66512.057084,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67532.43331200001,"text":"Neno bug hutumiwa na wataalamu wa wadudu katika maana rasmi kwa kundi hili la wadudu."},{"kind":"audio","t":67636.25576700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67641.764521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":67647.441951,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67651.930913,"samples":29034,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"input","t":74700.735799,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":76012.33223500001,"text":"Kwanza, waendesha wengi walikuwa wamevaa mabuti ya kuendesha yenye kisigino na soli laini, nyembamba kiasi."},{"kind":"audio","t":76169.48173700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76174.55409800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76179.85127500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76185.547206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76186.379341,"samples":7968,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":83922.25821300001,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":85091.25295200001,"text":"Tume hiyo ilikuwa majibu ya Martelli kwa maandamano mapana ya kupinga utawala yaliyoanza mwezi Oktoba."},{"kind":"audio","t":85210.491827,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85215.49692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85220.716079,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85225.892748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85226.213642,"samples":1838,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":91143.246369,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":92486.64698800001,"text":"Vikosi vya uokoaji na kuzima moto hatimaye vilizima moto huo ifikapo saa tano na dakika thelathini na tano usiku."},{"kind":"audio","t":92646.612171,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92651.78439,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92657.19969600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92662.563872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92667.870929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92668.922941,"samples":9473,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":97371.483063,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98434.426426,"text":"Dhoruba ya mkazo wa msimu wa kimbunga wa Atlantiki, Dhoruba ya Subtropic Jerry,"},{"kind":"audio","t":98534.12780300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98539.55439800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":98544.726008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98546.34890900001,"samples":11201,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":100227.245198,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100688.63604,"text":"iliunda katika Bahari ya Atlantiki leo."},{"kind":"audio","t":100748.433684,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100751.027199,"samples":20730,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":107244.95684700001,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":108097.20366500001,"text":"Imetufanya tufunze gari na vifaa vingine vingi vya usafirishaji."},{"kind":"audio","t":108188.41089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108193.764517,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108197.468542,"samples":23349,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"input","t":116621.324594,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117791.133059,"text":"Inajulikana kwa kuwa kitovu cha anasa kilichoanza mnamo mwaka 400 BK na kudumu hadi mwanzo wa"},{"kind":"audio","t":117917.269604,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117922.350495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117927.97236700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117933.18711500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117935.09377200001,"samples":14656,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":120745.936072,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121284.35095800001,"text":"hadi mnamo mwaka 1100 BK."},{"kind":"audio","t":121344.418867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121347.68371,"samples":24631,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"input","t":127071.78689,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127715.056972,"text":"Useo wa mwezi umeundwa kwa miamba na vumbi. Tabaka la nje la mwezi linaitwa gome."},{"kind":"audio","t":127794.204948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":127799.441626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127799.844909,"samples":5516,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"audio","t":127809.682067,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":127813.53685,"samples":25188,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":970},{"kind":"input","t":134215.61644399998,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135697.463443,"text":"Jeshi la Wahandisi la Marekani lilikadiria kuwa mvua ya inchi sita inaweza kuvunja kile kilichokuwa kimeharibika hapo awali"},{"kind":"audio","t":135841.450766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135846.63261499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":135852.332715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135857.742581,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":135863.06466799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135864.513602,"samples":12538,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":141188.44670899998,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142774.200071,"text":"Hasa, inadaiwa kuwa mtu anaweza kubaini ikiwa mtu mwingine anasema uongo kwa kutafsiri ishara ndogo za uso (micro-expressions) kwa usahihi."},{"kind":"audio","t":142935.25063499997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142940.10429999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142945.600564,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142951.03258899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142956.565472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142961.82634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142962.258362,"samples":5126,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":147238.862203,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":148204.31307099998,"text":"Usichafue eneo hili kwa kuandika au kukwaruza chora-chora kwenye muundo."},{"kind":"audio","t":148300.87144299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148306.024013,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148311.19387199997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148313.02430999998,"samples":14266,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":154879.01157899998,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156503.744919,"text":"Ngurumo ya chui si kama ngurumo yenye sauti nzito ya simba, bali ni kama mfululizo wa maneno ya kukwaruza yanayopigwa kelele."},{"kind":"audio","t":156631.070613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156636.067335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156642.15508899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156647.15226099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156650.19174799998,"samples":21065,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":161916.228588,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":163432.042372,"text":"Utafiti wa karne ya 20 umeonyesha kuwa kuna makundi mawili ya utofauti wa kijenetiki, yaliyofichika na yaliyojidhihirisha."},{"kind":"audio","t":163574.03086,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163579.10032099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163584.236041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163589.75704499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163595.076442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163595.448935,"samples":4458,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"close","t":173605.648969,"code":1005}]}